      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "PUT and DELETE are idempotent by HTTP contract; POST and PATCH are not. Make unsafe creates safe to retry with an Idempotency-Key (IETF draft).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PUT and DELETE are idempotent by HTTP contract; POST and PATCH are not. Make unsafe creates safe to retry with an Idempotency-Key (IETF draft).",
